        "title": "Add Build FREE button to CLI plan mode",
        "summary": "Added 'Build FREE' button to CLI plan mode interface. Propagated `onBuildFree` callback through `chat.tsx`, `use-chat-input.ts`, and component tree (`blocks`, `message-block`, `plan-box`). User can now trigger free build actions directly from rendered plan blocks.",
        "significance": "notable",
