      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "When the assistant shows you a plan in the command-line chat, you'll now see a new \"Build FREE\" button alongside the existing \"Build Fast\" and \"Build Max\" options. Clicking it runs a low-cost version of whatever the plan describes, instead of the faster (and pricier) builds the other buttons trigger. If you've been waiting for a cheaper way to act on a plan without choosing the highest-speed option, you can just pick it now.",
